[{"text": "I now give the floor to his excellency", "start": 0.88, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Son Pra, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister", "start": 4.08, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "for Foreign Affairs and International", "start": 8.24, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "Cooperation of Cambodia.", "start": 9.92, "duration": 7.799}, {"text": "I You have the floor, sir.", "start": 12.639, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 42.16, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "excellencies,", "start": 44.719, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "distinguished delegates,", "start": 47.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "first I wish to extend my warmest", "start": 50.559, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "congratulation to your excellency Dr.", "start": 53.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Khalilu Rahman on your election as", "start": 55.76, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "president of the 81st session of the", "start": 59.12, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "United Nation General Assembly.", "start": 62.8, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "Cambodia assure you of its full support", "start": 67.28, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "as you guide our work and the timely", "start": 70.159, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "theme restoring trust managing", "start": 73.92, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "transformation", "start": 77.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "a united nation that delivers for all.", "start": 79.28, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "I express Cambodia's appreciation to her", "start": 83.28, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "excensive", "start": 85.92, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "leadership of the ADF session.", "start": 91.2, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "It is my great honor to pay tribute to", "start": 95.36, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "Secretary General Antonio Gutes", "start": 98.64, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "for his steadfast leadership and", "start": 101.759, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "dedicated service to the United Nation", "start": 103.68, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "throughout his two mandates", "start": 107.92, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and for his unwavering commitment to", "start": 111.36, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "multilateralism,", "start": 114.24, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "peace and security,", "start": 116.479, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "sustainable development and the princ", "start": 118.64, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "principle and purposes of of the UN", "start": 121.68, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "charter during a decade marked by", "start": 124.56, "duration": 8.28}, {"text": "profound turbulence and transformation.", "start": 127.52, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 133.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "81 years ago,", "start": 135.52, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "in the aftermath of the devastation of", "start": 138.08, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "the Second World War,", "start": 140.319, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "the nation that founded our organization", "start": 142.64, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "made a solemn pledge to save succeeding", "start": 146.56, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "generation from the scourge of war.", "start": 150.959, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "That commitment remain as vital today as", "start": 155.12, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "it was in 1945.", "start": 158.56, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "While the world has thus far been spare", "start": 163.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "another global war,", "start": 165.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "armed conflicts continue to inflict", "start": 168.959, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "immense human suffering", "start": 171.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "across many region.", "start": 174.16, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "Concurrently,", "start": 176.959, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "geopolitical rivalries, climate change,", "start": 178.959, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "widening inequalities,", "start": 182.879, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "rapid technological transformation,", "start": 185.599, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "and transnational threat", "start": 188.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "are placing growing strain on", "start": 191.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "international peace, stability,", "start": 193.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "and cooperation.", "start": 197.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "At a time when international cooperation", "start": 200.56, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "is more necessary than ever,", "start": 202.72, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "trust among nation is being tested.", "start": 206.4, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "While confidence in multilateral", "start": 210.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "institution", "start": 213.28, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "and their capacity to respond", "start": 215.2, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "effectively to command challenges", "start": 217.28, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "is under increasing pressure.", "start": 220.319, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "Our response cannot be retrieved.", "start": 225.2, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "The world needs the new United Nation", "start": 228.799, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "not less but more.", "start": 233.04, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "But it also need a United Nation that", "start": 237.12, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "command trust", "start": 240.48, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "because it is principle, representative,", "start": 242.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "effective", "start": 247.2, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "and capable of delivering the purpose", "start": 248.72, "duration": 8.92}, {"text": "and principle of its charter.", "start": 252.48, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "Trust is not restored by declaration", "start": 257.919, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "alone.", "start": 261.12, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "It is earned through consistency.", "start": 262.639, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "When commitment are honored,", "start": 267.199, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "international law is respected.", "start": 270.0, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "Dispute are settled by peaceful means.", "start": 273.52, "duration": 9.119}, {"text": "So equality must remain a principle", "start": 278.08, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "fundamental principle of international", "start": 282.639, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "relation.", "start": 286.56, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "The charter does not prescribe one", "start": 288.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "standard for the powerful", "start": 291.199, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "and another for the less powerful.", "start": 293.6, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "All member states, large or small, are", "start": 296.72, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "equal before the charter", "start": 299.28, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "and are bound by the obligation it", "start": 301.84, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "establishes.", "start": 306.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 308.639, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Cambodia understands the value of trust", "start": 311.68, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "from its own history. Our country endure", "start": 314.0, "duration": 9.36}, {"text": "decades of conflict, genocide,", "start": 319.68, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "division and immense", "start": 323.36, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "human suffering.", "start": 325.84, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Cambodia rebuild peace through dialogue,", "start": 329.199, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "trust and confidence building", "start": 331.919, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "and the political courage and wisdom", "start": 334.56, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "embodied in our former prime minister", "start": 337.199, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "Joe Hunsen win-win policy", "start": 341.039, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "which brought national reconciliation", "start": 344.72, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "and unity.", "start": 348.24, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "That experience", "start": 351.52, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "continues to shape Cambodia's approach", "start": 354.639, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "to international relation and its", "start": 356.8, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "commitment to the peaceful settlement of", "start": 359.6, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "disputes,", "start": 361.759, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "including those concerning our share", "start": 363.6, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "border with Thailand.", "start": 365.759, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "In this spirit,", "start": 368.8, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "Cambodia expresses its sincere", "start": 370.8, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "appreciation to the international", "start": 373.039, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "community", "start": 375.039, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "for its continued attention,", "start": 376.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "contribution", "start": 379.84, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "and support for effort to achieve a", "start": 381.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "peaceful and lasting resolution of the", "start": 383.84, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "dispute.", "start": 386.72, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Recent tension and conflict have", "start": 391.199, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "seriously eroded trust and confidence", "start": 393.36, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "between Cambodia and Thailand.", "start": 397.199, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "Beyond putting a strain on relation,", "start": 400.479, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "this conflict has left deeper and more", "start": 404.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "enduring scars,", "start": 407.28, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "including damage damage to cultural", "start": 409.44, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "heritage", "start": 414.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "and lingering threat posed by unexloding", "start": 416.4, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "ordinance among others.", "start": 419.36, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "Yet geography bind us together.", "start": 422.96, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "As permanent neighbors, our two", "start": 427.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "countries would always live side by side", "start": 428.88, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "and peace, stability and prosperity of", "start": 432.88, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "our peoples", "start": 435.599, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "are closely interconnected.", "start": 437.52, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Rebuilding trust is therefore not merely", "start": 441.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "desirable.", "start": 444.8, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "It is essential to the future of our", "start": 447.36, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "bilateral relation and to a share", "start": 450.96, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "interest in lasting peace and good", "start": 454.4, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "neighborly relation", "start": 457.199, "duration": 3.961}, {"text": "for Cambodia. Restoring trust must be", "start": 461.599, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "grounded in concrete commitment.", "start": 464.4, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "It requires the full and effective", "start": 468.56, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "implementation", "start": 471.36, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "in good faith", "start": 472.96, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "of the agreement reached between our two", "start": 475.039, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "countries. These include the Kalamo", "start": 478.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "joint declaration,", "start": 480.879, "duration": 8.801}, {"text": "the FEAN consensus and in particular the", "start": 483.36, "duration": 10.64}, {"text": "joint statement of 27th December 2025", "start": 489.68, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "under which both sides committed to the", "start": 494.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "renunciation of the threat or use of", "start": 496.319, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "force,", "start": 498.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "respect for international boundary and", "start": 500.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "to concrete measure to deescalate", "start": 503.44, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "tension, rebuild trust", "start": 506.4, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "and advance the normalization of", "start": 509.28, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "bilateral relation.", "start": 511.919, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "Among those measures, the prompt", "start": 516.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "resumption of the survey and demarcation", "start": 518.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "work of the joint boundary commission", "start": 521.12, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "would contribute significantly to", "start": 524.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "addressing outstanding boundary related", "start": 526.64, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "claims", "start": 529.839, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "and establishing a clear and mutually", "start": 531.36, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "recognized boundary in accordance with", "start": 535.2, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "international law and the existing", "start": 538.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "treaty and agreement between the two", "start": 542.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "countries. Equally", "start": 543.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "important and with direct humanitarian", "start": 547.04, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "implication", "start": 550.48, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "is enabling the more than 20,000", "start": 552.64, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "Cambodian civilian who remain unable to", "start": 556.959, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "return to their home", "start": 560.72, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "due to the continued military occupation", "start": 564.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and obstruction.", "start": 567.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "In the words of the UN special reporter", "start": 570.0, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "who visited the border last July,", "start": 573.6, "duration": 11.359}, {"text": "they need and deserve to go home.", "start": 578.56, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "Likewise, the secession of activities", "start": 584.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and in occupied territories that could", "start": 587.6, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "create or consolidate a fairly", "start": 590.959, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "would provide a tangible demonstration", "start": 595.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "of goodwill and respect for", "start": 597.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "international law.", "start": 600.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "This same commitment to the peaceful", "start": 603.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "settlement of disputes", "start": 605.6, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "is reflected in our approach to the", "start": 608.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "maritime dispute between Cambodia and", "start": 611.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Thailand.", "start": 613.76, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "Last May, Thailand decided to", "start": 616.24, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "unilaterally terminated terminate", "start": 618.399, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "the MOU 2001,", "start": 623.12, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "the only existing legal framework", "start": 626.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "between our two country", "start": 630.16, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "specifically established to address our", "start": 632.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "maritime disputes", "start": 636.48, "duration": 8.599}, {"text": "despite our repeated call not to do so.", "start": 638.8, "duration": 6.279}, {"text": "Cambodia was thus forced to place its", "start": 645.279, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "trust in institution that uphold the", "start": 647.519, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "principle of international law by", "start": 651.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "initiating compass consiliation", "start": 654.399, "duration": 6.841}, {"text": "proceeding under UN encla's", "start": 656.959, "duration": 4.281}, {"text": "sovereignity and maritime rights in", "start": 674.959, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "accordance with international law.", "start": 678.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Cambodia has always sought to resolve", "start": 682.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "dispute with our neighbor peacefully.", "start": 684.72, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "We continue to seek a relation with", "start": 689.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Thailand based on peace, cooperation,", "start": 692.079, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "and mutual respect.", "start": 696.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Both Cambodia and Thailand stands to", "start": 699.2, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "gain from a fair and lasting settlement", "start": 702.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "agreed with the guidance of", "start": 706.24, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "international expert consiliator", "start": 707.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and in accordance with international", "start": 711.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "law.", "start": 713.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "In this connection,", "start": 716.079, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Cambodia is grateful to the consiliation", "start": 718.72, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "commission for demonstrating it strong", "start": 721.04, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "willingness to assist the parties in", "start": 723.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "resolving this dispute peacefully during", "start": 725.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "the first meeting in Singapore", "start": 729.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "earlier this month.", "start": 732.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "The value of consideration should be", "start": 734.32, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "approached as a meaningful opportunity", "start": 736.24, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "to bridging differences, rebuild trust,", "start": 738.639, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "and lay a stronger foundation for", "start": 742.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "peaceful and constructive relation", "start": 745.279, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "between our two countries.", "start": 747.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Mr. President, the question is no longer", "start": 750.959, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "whether our world is changing", "start": 754.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "but whether they can shape that change", "start": 757.279, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "together and turn transformation into", "start": 759.76, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "opportunities", "start": 762.639, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "rather than division and insecurity.", "start": 764.48, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Technology illustrate both the promise", "start": 768.399, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "and the risk.", "start": 771.04, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Artificial intelligence and digital", "start": 773.2, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "innovation can accelerate development", "start": 775.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and expand opportunities.", "start": 778.32, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "But their misuse can also deepen", "start": 780.8, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "inequality, insecurity and transnational", "start": 783.279, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "crime.", "start": 787.519, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Combating online scam has become one of", "start": 789.44, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "our highest national priority.", "start": 791.839, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "Cambia Cambodia has strengthened its", "start": 795.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "legal and institutional framework and", "start": 797.92, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "intensify law enforcement operation", "start": 801.68, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "against camp center and the criminal", "start": 804.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "network behind them with undeniable", "start": 807.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "result.", "start": 811.12, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "But no country can succeed alone.", "start": 813.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Criminal networks operate across border", "start": 817.44, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "and require stronger international", "start": 819.6, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 821.839, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "This week, Cambodia has successfully", "start": 823.839, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "hosted an inter", "start": 826.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "uh international conference on combating", "start": 830.639, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "online scam co-sponsored by UN DOC and", "start": 832.8, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "Interpol among others. The conference", "start": 837.519, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "called for a collective and coordinated", "start": 840.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "action at national, regional and global", "start": 843.12, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "levels to disrupt and erod eradicate", "start": 846.72, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "this crime.", "start": 850.079, "duration": 3.241}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 854.0, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Cambodia is pleased and honored to host", "start": 856.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "in Nonen on the 15th and 16th of", "start": 859.76, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "November next the 20th summit of Leaf", "start": 862.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Francoi.", "start": 865.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Nearly 30 years after the historic Hanoi", "start": 868.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "summit, this new gathering of the", "start": 871.44, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "Frenchspeaking community in Asia carries", "start": 873.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "particular significance.", "start": 876.639, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "It demonstrates the vitality of a", "start": 879.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "franophony that transcends borders,", "start": 881.44, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "continents, and cultural differences.", "start": 884.079, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "The theme of the summit, reinvesting in", "start": 887.279, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "peace for shared and sustainable", "start": 890.399, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "prosperity, together with that of this", "start": 892.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "year's session, reflects a common", "start": 894.56, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "imperative.", "start": 897.04, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "Restoring trust and reinvesting in peace", "start": 898.56, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "reinforce one another.", "start": 901.839, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Beyond celebrating the French language,", "start": 905.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Cambodia wishes to make this summit a", "start": 908.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "moment of bringing together peoples from", "start": 911.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "all continents around shared values,", "start": 913.68, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "peace, respect for diversity,", "start": 917.04, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "dialogue among cultures, solidarity,", "start": 921.92, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "mutual understanding and cooperation.", "start": 925.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "The presence of heads of state and", "start": 929.36, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "government will give this summit its", "start": 931.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "full political and symbolic significance", "start": 933.36, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "and will make Nenen a major venue for", "start": 937.44, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "dialogue among nations.", "start": 941.04, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "The Kingdom of the Ankor temples looks", "start": 944.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "forward to welcoming everyone with the", "start": 947.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "hospitality for which it is known. Mr.", "start": 950.16, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "President,", "start": 952.56, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "we cannot restore the world of", "start": 954.399, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "yesterday, nor should that be our", "start": 956.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "ambition. Our responsibility is to", "start": 958.56, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "strengthen our confidence in our", "start": 961.92, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "collective ability to navigate the world", "start": 963.839, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "of tomorrow.", "start": 966.32, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "To restore trust, we must uphold the", "start": 968.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "same principles for all. To manage", "start": 971.44, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "transformation, we must ensure that", "start": 974.0, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "progress serves everyone. And for the", "start": 976.639, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "United Nations to deliver results for", "start": 980.079, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "all, every member state, whether large", "start": 982.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "or small, developed or developing, must", "start": 985.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "see its dignity, its voice, and its", "start": 988.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "future reflected in this organization.", "start": 991.6, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Cambodia will continue to work with all", "start": 994.8, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "member states towards this goal, as it", "start": 996.959, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "has done by contributing more than", "start": 999.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "10,000 of its peacekeepers to United", "start": 1001.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Nations peacekeeping operations over the", "start": 1004.399, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "past 20 years. Thank you very much for", "start": 1006.48, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "your attention.", "start": 1008.56, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "I thank the deputy prime minister,", "start": 1018.399, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "Minister for Foreign Affairs and", "start": 1020.88, "duration": 6.199}, {"text": "International Cooperation of Cambodia.", "start": 1022.56, "duration": 4.519}, {"text": "I now give the floor to her excellency", "start": 1028.959, "duration": 4.401}]